  <description>
    <p>Save the instructions you give AI again and again. Press a key and they bloom around your cursor as petals. Click one and its words go into the box you were typing in.</p>
    <p>Free holds five prompts you write and edit yourself. Pro holds as many as you like, with petals for each app, workflows, packs, and sync with your Mac and your phone.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">com.promptpetal.PromptPetal.desktop</launchable>
